@baseUrl = http://localhost:5173
@variantId = 1
@priceRuleId = 1

### Load a variant's assigned and available scoped price rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/variants/{{variantId}}/price-rules

### Assign a scoped price rule to a variant
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/variants/{{variantId}}/price-rules/{{priceRuleId}}

### Remove a scoped price rule from a variant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/variants/{{variantId}}/price-rules/{{priceRuleId}}